          %h2#examples Examples
          %h3#various Various
          .num_example
            %h6#example Example
            %p
              Every manifold admits the
              %em trivial Poisson structure
              for which the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Poisson+bracket"} Poisson bracket
              simply vanishes on all elements.
          .num_example
            %h6#example_2 Example
            %p
              Every
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/symplectic+manifold"} symplectic manifold
