                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi X
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \omega \in \Omega_{cl}^2(X)
              is a
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/symplectic+form"} symplectic form
              if it is non-degenerate in that the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/kernel"} kernel
              of the operation of contracting with
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/vector+fields"} vector fields
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi ι
                      %mrow
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                        %mo{:lspace => "verythinmathspace", :rspace => "0em"} −
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %mi ω
                    %mo{:lspace => "verythinmathspace"} :
                    %mi Vect
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi X
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %mo ⟶
                    %msup
                      %mi Ω
                      %mn 1
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi X
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"}
